OL,3,GNEWSAIsland inflation rate rises to 3%,
OL,4,Afigures show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual rate of inflation in Jersey
OL,7,Frose to 3% in September, according to
OL,8,Fnew figures.
OL,10,FJersey's retail price index (RPI) rose
OL,11,F0.2 percentage points since June when
OL,12,Fit was 2.8%.
OL,14,FStatistics Jersey said increases in the
OL,15,Fcost of household services, alcoholic
OL,16,Fdrinks and food made the most notable
OL,17,Fcontributions to annual rate of
OL,18,Finflation.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
