OL,3,GNEWSAIsland inflation rate rises to 3%,
OL,4,Afigures show
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said there were also "substantial
OL,7,Fincreases" in the price of some fuels,
OL,8,Fwith heating oil and other fuels
OL,9,Fincreasing by 47.7% across the year,
OL,10,Fwhile petrol and oil increased by
OL,11,F22.7%. It said food prices increased by
OL,12,F3.5% and housing costs by 0.2%.
